  "description": "Yoo Seoha, the 'Child of the Dragon,' possesses a mysterious ability to see the future of those destined to be kings. \n\n['The Child of the Dragon' is drawing 'the King' and hopes to acquire 'the Martial God.']\n\nTo protect her loved one, Seoha makes an irreversible choice. As a result, she becomes a fugitive, bearing the label of a traitor, while Myung seizes the throne that rightfully belongs to Seoha.\n\nTen years later, in her quest to reclaim what is hers, Woo reveals herself to the world, and Myung is determined not to let anything be taken from her again as they confront each other once more...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65436742), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9A%A9%EC%9D%84-%EA%B7%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%8A%94-%EC%95%84%EC%9D%B4/4306)",
